cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Open Anesthesia Simulator"
abstract: >-
  An open-source, deterministic anesthesia simulator for education. It models
  volatile-agent delivery, uptake and distribution through an explicit
  breathing circuit, alveolar gas, blood and tissue compartments. It is an
  educational tool, not a clinical prediction, dosing or monitoring device.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Feichtinger
    given-names: Stuart
    email: stuthedew@users.noreply.github.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/stuthedew/open-anesthesia-sim"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - anesthesiology
  - pharmacokinetics
  - inhaled anesthetics
  - uptake and distribution
  - simulation
  - medical education
